# Prompt Dev rules

- use existing components to assemble the screen
- do not export or generate images where configuration using HTML and Tailwind is possible
- do not export or generate images, as they likely already exist in @public/images
- do not use fixed widths and heights; use max-width and padding
- use the <br/> tag for line breaks within text; do not create a separate <p> tag
- use images located in @public/images
- when configuring images, use the `addBasePathToPath` function.
- use pixel (px) measurements
- when generating components, classify them (e.g., title, card) and group them into folders.
- if it doesn't exist, create the storybook story for the newly created component as well.
- manage the stories within the `stories` folder and group them by type (title, card, etc.).